{"version":1,"key":"card:17","content":{"id":17,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数类型的声明，例如声明一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"add","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function add(x: number, y: number): number {\n  return x + y;\n}\n\nconst add = function (x:number, y:number): number {\n  return x + y;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"2f495ad5-76d5-4263-8752-e9276711ffd8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除此之外可以单独为函数标注类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const add: (number, number) => number = function(x, y){\n  return x + y;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"2a200c7c-d8c5-46ca-8a9e-ad1b9d6c8779","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"箭头函数的标注"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const add = (x: number, y: number): number => {\n  return x + y;\n}\n\n\nconst add: (number, number) => number = (x, y) => {\n  return x + y;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"507ba39f-69d6-44a5-912a-a98043fb4006","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于函数类型，一般我们会为其声明一个别名，一个是看起来清晰，二个是方便复用，如果多个函数有相同的函数类型，每次都写函数类型会很麻烦"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"type OperateFunc = (number, number) => number;\nconst add: OperateFunc = (x, y) => {\n  return x + y;\n}\nconst minus: OperateFunc = (x, y) => {\n  return x - y;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"81c0bbf7-aeb1-4b1f-b09b-0e110c37500c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"甚至可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"interface","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行函数声明,这时的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"interface","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 被称为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Callable Interface","code":true